From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 12:48:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 031/117] MAINTAINERS: add Apple J172 battery support

The J172 battery stack spans board-specific bindings and Apple
power-supply drivers but lacked a dedicated maintenance entry.

Add the J172 BQ27545 binding together with the Bellatrix and D2365 files
under an Apple battery and USB power section with the Asahi and
power-management lists. The generic W1 UART master and BQ27xxx HDQ
family driver remain under their existing subsystem ownership.

Signed-off-by: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>

Orchard-replay-of: c1dd06229023993148c25064a121c47e69348708
---
 MAINTAINERS | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index d1b553476..3df1806e9 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -2716,6 +2716,17 @@ F:	include/linux/mfd/macsmc.h
 F:	include/linux/soc/apple/*
 F:	include/uapi/drm/asahi_drm.h
 
+APPLE J172 BATTERY AND USB POWER SUPPORT
+M:	Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
+L:	asahi@lists.linux.dev
+L:	linux-pm@vger.kernel.org
+S:	Maintained
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/apple,bellatrix.yaml
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/apple,d2365-charger.yaml
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/ti,bq27545-hdq.yaml
+F:	drivers/power/supply/apple_bellatrix_power.c
+F:	drivers/power/supply/apple_d2365_charger.c
+
 APPLE J172 TOUCHSCREEN SUPPORT
 M:	Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
 L:	asahi@lists.linux.dev
